		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A skeletal dragon, cunning and dire, burning with green balefire. Its baleful breath is almost certain death.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +9 (2d10) or 1 death breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from dragon. DEX 15+ or 5d10 damage. Creatures reduced to 0 HP die, become shadows loyal to ravener.</p><p></p><p><strong>Supreme Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
